<title>POLAND: POLISH FOOD PRICES RISE 0.1 PCT IN MARCH 11-20.</title>
<headline>POLISH FOOD PRICES RISE 0.1 PCT IN MARCH 11-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.1</p>
<p>percent in the March 11-20 period after rising 0.2 percent in</p>
<p>the previous 10 days and were 0.3 percent higher than in the</p>
<p>February 11-20 period, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				 MARCH 11-20  MARCH 1-10  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.1	   0.2	  0.3 (0.2)</p>
<p> Bread				0.2	   0.5	  1.1 (1.3)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	   0.7	   1.0	  1.3 (0.1)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.1	  -0.3	 -0.8(-0.8)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.5	   0.7	  1.5 (1.4)</p>
<p> Eggs				 0.1	  -2.0	 -3.7(-4.7)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period</p>
<p>ending on March 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
